OL,3,GNEWSACrash deaths police force promised
OL,4,Aa further #3.2m
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police force is set to receive a
OL,7,Ffurther #3.2m in the wake of a crash
OL,8,Fthat saw to the deaths of seven people,
OL,9,Fincluding two of its officers, and
OL,10,Fprompted a large-scale operation
OL,11,Ftackling organised crime.
OL,13,FPolicing Minister Sarah Jones announced
OL,14,Fthe money to meet Cleveland Police's
OL,15,F"additional costs" incurred after the
OL,16,Fcollision on the A66 at South Bank,
OL,17,Fnear Middlesbrough, on 22 August.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
