OL,3,GNEWSACrash deaths police force promised
OL,4,Aa further #3.2m
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe cash is on top of #2m previously
OL,7,Fpledged, but not yet paid, by Home
OL,8,FSecretary Shabana Mahmood amid claims
OL,9,Fthe force was unfairly penalised by
OL,10,Fnational funding rules.
OL,12,FLabour MP for Middlesbrough and
OL,13,FThornaby Andy McDonald welcomed the
OL,14,Flatest move but said Cleveland Police
OL,15,Fneeded a long-term solution.
